{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港小姐2026｜在《2026香港小姐競選》湖南外景拍攝期間，馮盈盈（Crystal）化身突擊隊長，成功闖入 3 號李澄晴（Chorie）與 9 號周芳姿（Gracia）的酒店房間，為網民帶來一場別開生面的行李箱開箱！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p id=\"p-rc_fad05f933864aad0-434\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">馮盈盈進入房間後，焦點隨即鎖定李澄晴的粉紅色行李箱。一打開箱子，眾人皆驚呼：從衫褲、帽飾到護膚面膜包裝，全都是清一色的粉紅色，且收納極為整齊。馮盈盈不禁大讚她是名副其實的「粉紅色控」。</p><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_fad05f933864aad0-435\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">另一邊，周芳姿大方展示行李，拿出一條粉底白點的厚毛絨褲，並自爆這是她睡覺必須抱著的。當馮盈盈好奇詢問「點解你係抱住一條褲嘅？」時，周芳姿感性分享，這條褲子是由外婆親手縫製的，承載了祖孫間長達十多年的深厚情感，令房間瞬間充滿溫馨感。</p><p id=\"p-rc_fad05f933864aad0-435\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4f84279c-287e-4350-8921-10d3fa9dfe44.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026rChgaRsV7Z1783677124.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4f84279c-287e-4350-8921-10d3fa9dfe44.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"01c1d319-5161-4556-bd58-5d12f5a79adf.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026QQqSt7wkNc1783677114.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"01c1d319-5161-4556-bd58-5d12f5a79adf.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"source-inline-chip-container luminous-sources hide-from-message-actions ng-star-inserted\" data-rich-content=\"true\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></div><p id=\"p-rc_fad05f933864aad0-436\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">除了行李箱秘辛，周芳姿還分享了自己的睡前保養小習慣——「金剛跪」，就是在床上雙膝跪地，雙腳跟合攏，跪著保持約 20 分鐘。周芳姿指這動作能拉伸脾胃及膀胱經。馮盈盈與李澄晴隨即在床上嘗試，雖然畫面搞笑，但平日充滿活力的馮盈盈僅跪了一會兒便直呼：「好似對腳冇乜血到喎！」 最後馮盈盈更笑言，應該召集齊 12 位佳麗第二天起床一起「金剛跪」，作為應對比賽挑戰前的拉伸熱身。</p><p id=\"p-rc_fad05f933864aad0-436\" style=\"text-align: left; caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"06b9e5f0-e124-4c67-b4e8-881cb9cafc1c.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026XKejQdmMhY1783677119.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"06b9e5f0-e124-4c67-b4e8-881cb9cafc1c.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-14T08:19:59.247397+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":502,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}